# Gebeta Core Rules

- Read `/AGENTS.md` before making changes.
- Follow `/docs/DEMO_SCOPE.md` for hackathon priorities.
- Follow `/docs/PRODUCT_REQUIREMENTS.md` for expected product behavior.
- Follow `/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for the selected architecture.
- Follow `/docs/UI_UX_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` for visual design.
- This is a hackathon demo, not a complete production implementation.
- Prefer working vertical journeys over incomplete feature breadth.
- Inspect existing code before changing it.
- Never invent API endpoints, database tables, or integrations.
- Clearly label mock data and mock AI results.
- Do not expose server secrets in frontend code.
- Preserve privacy and role boundaries.
- Do not make medical claims or fabricate nutrition data.
- Run relevant checks after implementation.
